            },
            "reviewBody": "Really fresh and beautiful colors. I love the vinegar flavor.",
            "datePublished": "2020-05-25T01:01:55.287Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MomCarole"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is wonderful! The only change that I made was to add only 1/2 of the amount of ketchup that was suggested. I also omitted the onion at first and realized that it didn't have enough zing, so after adding the onion and marinating it over night, it was fabulous. I also sent the receipt over to one of my friends that loves to cook too. Thanks so much to author of the recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2017-09-04T20:08:36.010Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Felicia"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A macaroni salad that wasn't just a macaroni salad. I thought it was cool and refreshing. This recipe made a huge amount. Next time I try it I will cut the recipe in half, even if it is for a potluck.",
            "datePublished": "2016-06-02T15:22:29.977Z"
          },
          {
